   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Thank you Terrence! I followed your instructions using this code:<div><br></div></div></div><blockquote style=\"margin:0 0 0 40px;border:none;padding:0px\"><div><div><div><div><font color=\"#444444\">model&lt;-&#39;</font></div></div></div></div><div><div><div><div><font color=\"#444444\">ifreq =~ 1*freq1 + 1*freq2 + 1*freq3 + 1*freq4</font></div></div></div></div><div><div><div><div><font color=\"#444444\">ipsy =~ 1*psy1 + 1*psy2 + 1*psy3 + 1*psy4</font></div></div></div></div><div><div><div><div><font color=\"#444444\"><br></font></div></div></div></div><div><div><div><div><font color=\"#444444\">sfreq =~ 0*freq1 + 1*freq2 + 2*freq3 + 3*freq4</font></div></div></div></div><div><div><div><div><font color=\"#444444\">spsy =~ 0*psy1 + 1*psy2 + 2*psy3 + 3*psy4</font></div></div></div></div><div><div><div><div><font color=\"#444444\"><br></font></div></div></div></div><div><div><div><div><font color=\"#444444\">ifreq ~ 0*1</font></div></div></div></div><div><div><div><div><font color=\"#444444\">ipsy ~ 0*1</font></div></div></div></div><div><div><div><div><font color=\"#444444\"><br></font></div></div></div></div><div><div><div><div><font color=\"#444444\">freq1 | 0*t1</font></div></div></div></div><div><div><div><div><font color=\"#444444\">freq2 | 0*t1</font></div></div></div></div><div><div><div><div><font color=\"#444444\">freq3 | 0*t1</font></div></div></div></div><div><div><div><div><font color=\"#444444\">freq4 | 0*t1</font></div></div></div></div><div><div><div><div><font color=\"#444444\"><br></font></div></div></div></div><div><div><div><div><font color=\"#444444\">psy1 | 0*t1</font></div></div></div></div><div><div><div><div><font color=\"#444444\">psy2 | 0*t1</font></div></div></div></div><div><div><div><div><font color=\"#444444\">psy3 | 0*t1</font></div></div></div></div><div><div><div><div><font color=\"#444444\">psy4 | 0*t1</font></div></div></div></div></blockquote></div>"
    ],
    [
     2,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><blockquote style=\"margin:0 0 0 40px;border:none;padding:0px\"><div><div><div><div><font color=\"#444444\">&#39;</font></div></div></div></div><div><div><div><div><font color=\"#444444\"><br></font></div></div></div></div><div><div><div><div><font color=\"#444444\">fit&lt;-runMI(model, milist, </font></div></div></div></div><div><div><div><div><font color=\"#444444\">            estimator=&quot;WLSMV&quot;, fun=&quot;growth&quot;, </font></div></div></div></div></blockquote></div>"
    ],
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><blockquote style=\"margin:0 0 0 40px;border:none;padding:0px\"><div><div><div><div><font color=\"#444444\">            ordered=c(&quot;freq1&quot;, &quot;freq2&quot;, &quot;freq3&quot;, &quot;freq4&quot;,</font></div></div></div></div><div><div><div><div><font color=\"#444444\">                      &quot;psy1&quot;, &quot;psy2&quot;, &quot;psy3&quot;, &quot;psy4&quot;))</font></div></div></div></div></blockquote><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><font color=\"#444444\"><br></font></div><div><font color=\"#000000\">However, this error code appeared:</font></div><div><font color=\"#444444\"><br></font></div></div></div><blockquote style=\"margin:0 0 0 40px;border:none;padding:0px\"><div><div><div><div><font color=\"#990000\">Error in lav_partable_flat(FLAT, blocks = &quot;group&quot;, meanstructure = meanstructure,  : </font></div></div></div></div><div><div><div><div><font color=\"#990000\">  lavaan ERROR: expected 4 threshold(s) for variable ‘freq1’; syntax contains 1</font></div></div></div></div></blockquote><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><font color=\"#990000\"><br></font></div><div><font color=\"#000000\">Any suggestions on how to proceed/fix the code?</font></div><div><font color=\"#000000\"><br></font></div><div><font color=\"#000000\">Thanks!</font></div></div></div></div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div>"
