,102,0)\">~</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,102,102)\">0</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">*</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,102,102)\">1</span></div></code></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><div><div>Terrence D. Jorgensen</div><div>Assistant Professor, Methods and Statistics</div><div>Research Institute for Child Development and Education, the University of Amsterdam</div><div>UvA web page: <a href=\"http://www.uva.nl/profile/t.d.jorgensen\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.uva.nl/profile/t.d.jorgensen&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792424005648000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0dMoLxELdk58B6z1AY1CG_\">http://www.uva.nl/profile/t.d.jorgensen</a></div></div></div><div><br></div></div>\r\n\r\n<p></p></blockquote></div>"
