     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">However, this error code appeared:</span><br></div><div><font color=\"#444444\"><br></font></div></div></div><blockquote style=\"margin:0 0 0 40px;border:none;padding:0px\"><div><div><div><div><font color=\"#990000\">Error in lav_partable_flat(FLAT, blocks = &quot;group&quot;, meanstructure = meanstructure,  : </font></div></div></div></div><div><div><div><div><font color=\"#990000\">  lavaan ERROR: expected 4 threshold(s) for variable ‘freq1’; syntax contains 1</font></div></div></div></div></blockquote><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><font color=\"#990000\"><br></font></div><div><font color=\"#000000\">Any suggestions on how to proceed/fix the code?</font></div></div></div></div></blockquote><div><br></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Have you read the paper yet?  freq1 clearly has 5 categories, so you need to fix 4 thresholds to some kind of meaningful values, as the paper shows.</div><div><br></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(68,68,68)\"><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">freq1 </span><span style=\"color:#660\">|</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">*</span><span style=\"color:#000\">t1 </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">*</span><span style=\"color:#000\">t2 </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">*</span><span style=\"color:#000\">t3 </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">3</span><span style=\"color:#660\">*</span><span style=\"color:#000\">t4</span></div></code></div><br></span><br></div></div>"
